{"title":"Main Page/Suggestions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><pre>If you want to edit something on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Main_Page\" title=\"Main Page\">Main Page</a>, just edit this page and the administrators will take your suggestions into consideration.\n</pre>\n<p><br />  \n</p>\n<div class=\"frontlink\" style=\"background-color:#1b365d; color:#fff; font-size: 110%; padding-left:15px; padding-right:15px; padding-bottom:10px;\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 200%\">Welcome to the AoPS Wiki!</b>\n</p><p>The AoPS Wiki project is administered by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\"><span style=\"color:#83a1d6;\">Art of Problem Solving</span></a> for supporting educational content useful to avid math students. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:none;background-color:darkred;padding:10px;color:white;text-align:center;margin-top:10px;\">\n<p>During AMC testing, the AoPS Wiki is in read-only mode. No edits can be made.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;\">\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <div style=\"height:calc(100% - 10px);background-color:#fff; overflow:hidden; margin:10px 5px 0 0;\">\n      <div style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border-top:10px solid #1b365d;padding:0.5em;padding-top: 0px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:5px 0px 0px 0px;border-bottom: 1px solid; color: #1b365d;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Popular_Topics\">Popular Topics</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:2px;color:#1b365d;font-size: 1.17em;font-weight: bold;\">Mathematics</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 1.6em;\">\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC Problems and Solutions\"> AMC Problems</a> </li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proofs_without_words\" title=\"Proofs without words\">Proofs Without Words</a> </li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:2px;color:#1b365d;font-size: 1.17em;font-weight: bold;\">Resources</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 1.6em;\">\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic Competitions</a> </li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic Scholarships</a></li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Math Competition Resources</a></li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_programs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics summer programs\">Math Summer Programs</a></li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:FAQ\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:FAQ\">Art of Problem Solving FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:2px;color:#1b365d;font-size: 1.17em;font-weight: bold;\">Tutorials</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 1.6em;\">\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX\" title=\"LaTeX\"> LaTeX Tutorial</a> </li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote_(Vector_Graphics_Language)\" title=\"Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)\"> Asymptote Tutorial (LaTeX Graphics)</a> </li>\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Getting_Started_With_Python_Programming\" title=\"Getting Started With Python Programming\">Python Programming Tutorial</a> </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <div style=\"min-height: 160px; max-height: 260px;background-color:#fff; overflow:hidden; margin:10px auto 10px 5px;\">\n      <div style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border-top:10px solid #1b365d;padding:0.5em;padding-top: 0px;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:5px 0px 0px 0px;border-bottom: 1px solid; color: #1b365d;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_of_the_Week\">Problem of the Week</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t<span style=\"color:#1b365d;font-size: 1.17em;font-weight: bold;\">\n        1984 AIME, Problem 12\n\t</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\tA <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined for all real numbers and satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/a/1ea76d26fe0b4be2d33ea4a9aab120cabc2d66a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2+x)=f(2-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faa40ac3ece33d925e19d671ecc7153e8683f3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(7+x)=f(7-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> is a root for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c9cbf3e3c04dc46dea71f60acd0cb704eabc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />, what is the least number of roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c9cbf3e3c04dc46dea71f60acd0cb704eabc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> must have in the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3dfb4f87c58a0a686d321de5d4059f5598e371c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1000\\leq x \\leq 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"min-height: 192px; max-height: 370px;background-color:#fff; overflow:hidden; margin: 5px auto 0px 5px;\">\n      <div style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border-top:10px solid #1b365d; padding:0.5em;padding-top: 0px;\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:RecentChanges\" title=\"Special:RecentChanges\"><h2 style=\"margin:5px 0px 0px 0px;border-bottom: 1px solid; color: #1b365d;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recent_Changes\">Recent Changes</span></h2></a>\n<div class=\"mw-changeslist\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<ul class=\"special\">\n<li> <span class=\"mw-title\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-changeslist-title\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19</a></bdi></span></li>\n<li> <span class=\"mw-title\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-changeslist-title\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24</a></bdi></span></li>\n<li> <span class=\"mw-title\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-changeslist-title\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11</a></bdi></span></li>\n<li> <span class=\"mw-title\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-changeslist-title\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5</a></bdi></span></li>\n<li> <span class=\"mw-title\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-changeslist-title\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 1</a></bdi></span></li>\n\n</ul>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 1.6em;\">\n<li> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:RecentChanges\" title=\"Special:RecentChanges\">More...</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#fff; border-top:10px solid #1b365d; padding:0.5em; padding-top: 0px;margin-top:10px;\">\n<h2 style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid; color: #1b365d;\"><span id=\"New_to_the_AoPS_Wiki.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_to_the_AoPS_Wiki?\">New to the AoPS Wiki?</span></h2>\n<p>If you're new to editing a wiki, we recommend starting with the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">tutorial</a>. Before you start editing, please familiarize yourself with the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"Category:AoPS Wiki\">articles related to AoPS Wiki</a>, especially the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Policy\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Policy\">policies</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Guidelines\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Guidelines\">guidelines</a>. For future reference, you can visit the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Contents\" title=\"Help:Contents\">help files</a>.\n</p><p>You can also check out <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_AoPS_Wiki_is_not\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not\">what AoPS Wiki is not</a> to better understand its scope. Additionally, take a moment to read <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_makes_AoPS_Wiki_different\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:What makes AoPS Wiki different\">why AoPS Wiki stands apart</a> from other online resources.\n</p><p>AoPS Wiki is powered by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MediaWiki\" title=\"MediaWiki\">MediaWiki</a> software.\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093957\nCache expiry: 15\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2575/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3087/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.465      1 -total\n 62.10%   33.200      1 Template:Recentchanges\n 52.77%   28.214      1 Special:SimpleChanges/5\n 25.99%   13.895      1 Template:Weekly